WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I think the temperature will be very low this year

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The vegetables at the base need to be battered in the greenhouse.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
But we have no materials

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Polymer materials developed by our research institute before Mohs

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
It can be used on plastic greenhouses and has good thermal insulation properties

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
There is a cold wave at the end of the month

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Mohs second to fourth year

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
It has been cold and snowy for three whole years

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Plus dry sweat

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
In this life, we must be before the natural disaster comes

11
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Put up the rest of the base

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Where is your research institute?

13
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,030
I'll move everything back for you

14
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,030
If you can’t finish eating, don’t eat it.

15
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:31,250
The leftovers can be fed to pigs and not wasted

16
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:32,250
Help them settle into their room

17
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:36,420
Take them to start production

18
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,420
Production is at the heart of everything

19
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,680
One month of tax exemption in the initial period

20
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,680
After that, each person will receive ten minutes a day

21
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,680
Who doesn't work
